    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "got it. so for the dead load, i should just use the specific weight of the cedar boards and the posts? also, for the live load, what's the standard psi or psf requirement for residential decks in bc? i want to make sure the joists don't sag over time.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
