      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. one more thing, i'm worried about the connection points where the beam meets the ledger. sometimes things just feel unstable or like there's some hidden weakness in the wood grain that might cause a failure later on. any tips on how to spot or prevent those kind of sudden structural weak points?",
